'''Leash''' is a status effect that prevents affected units from casting some mobility spells, sharing the same list as [[root]].

== Mechanics ==
[[File:Leash error message.png|thumb|250px|Attempting to blink while leashed.]]
<section begin=Intro />Leash disables casting several mobility abilities (e.g. [[Blink]]-based abilities) and it shares a few interactions with the [[Root]] mechanic. Although, Leash prevents casting certain abilities, it does not cancel them when getting leashed while the ability is cast. Leash also does not interrupt [[channeling]], but it always cancels {{I|Town Portal Scroll}}'s teleport.<section end=Intro />
{{clr}}

